{"id":1789561,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-06T17:25:48.040Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"https://www.makingthelinedocumentary.com/","id":1789561,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Making The Line","overview":"MAKING THE LINE is a character-driven feature documentary that delves into the world of competitive Hula — where athleticism and artistry are inseparable from a living Hawaiian cultural tradition. At its heart are Kumu Keano and Kumu Lono, two master Hula teachers and life partners who lead a diverse group of dancers striving for excellence in the art and discipline of Hula.  Guided by two modern-day queer Kanaka whose lives infuse the story with emotional truth and cultural nuance, MAKING THE LINE unfolds over three years, exploring tradition, resilience, and identity in a rapidly changing Hawaiʻi. As the demands of excellence intensify, so do the complexities of life both on and off the line. Their story becomes a portrait of devotion, transformation, and the enduring power of Hula — revealing that it is far more than dance; it is the heartbeat of a people.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/8WYr59lZHOubcGTKGpYzIaelidK.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":313324,"logo_path":null,"name":"VAULT FILMS","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":98,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Planned","tagline":"Discipline. Devotion. Legacy. Hula.","title":"Making The Line","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6529145,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Zilla Barbosa","original_name":"Zilla Barbosa","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6ac4a8e941da57c450f26842","department":"Directing","job":"Dire